SUMMARY:Dizzy & Fay
DESCRIPTION:Amanda Walther – vocals\nMark Lalama – piano \n \nCOVER: $20 \nDizzy & Fay — Mark Lalama (piano) and Amanda Walther (voice) — a songwriting team performing 100% original songs. Their music sits at the intersection of contemporary jazz and singer-songwriter intimacy\, offering sophisticated\, approachable performances that resonate with both jazz enthusiasts and broader audiences. Praised for their dynamic live chemistry\, Dizzy & Fay create shows that feel alive\, spontaneous\, and deeply connected\, drawing listeners into each song while showcasing the nuance\, interplay\, and energy of their live show.
URL:https://jazzbistro.ca/event/dizzy-fay-2/
END:VEVENT
